cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DockLab in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "DockLab: Local Molecular Docking & Visualization Platform"
abstract: >-
  DockLab is a local-first molecular docking and visualization platform for
  drug discovery and computational chemistry research. It integrates molecular
  preprocessing, binding pocket prediction, AutoDock Vina docking, and
  interactive 3D result analysis in a reproducible scientific workflow.
authors:
  - name: MCXDL
date-released: 2026-07-31
version: 0.8.0
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/MCXDL/docklab
keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - cadd
  - drug discovery
  - cheminformatics
  - bioinformatics
  - autodock-vina
  - rdkit
  - fastapi
  - vue3
  - 3dmol
